      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخرقهُ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>caused him to be confounded,</i> or <i>perplexed, so that he was unable to
see his right course;</i> or <i>caused him to be bereft
of his reason,</i> or <i>intellect.</i> (S, K.)

